    "detailed_description": "RESBS is a first-person space survival simulation where you and your friends cooperate to survive in zero gravity on a space station.Your movement is completely free, without any restrictions on direction.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/18ed20c667eefef98301422a77da92cc.poster.avif?t=1677268388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/18ed20c667eefef98301422a77da92cc.webm?t=1677268388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/18ed20c667eefef98301422a77da92cc.mp4?t=1677268388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>When your crew encounters an emergency during a mission and loses contact with Earth and resources, you need all the materials at your disposal to survive in a vacuum.<br>\u00b7Growing vegetables in space<br>\u00b7Exploring abandoned space stations<br>\u00b7Searching for supplies<br>\u00b7Repairing space capsules destroyed by space debris.<br>\u00b7If necessary, you even need to do the docking of the capsule.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/1c532aa00014fdba68498fa128f3f9bc.poster.avif?t=1677268388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/1c532aa00014fdba68498fa128f3f9bc.webm?t=1677268388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/1c532aa00014fdba68498fa128f3f9bc.mp4?t=1677268388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The outer equipment and outer shell of the space station are often damaged by space debris. You need to wear a heavy space suit to repair the outer shell of the space station in the vacuum. <br>In short, you need to arrange your resources properly, expand your farm, and acquire more equipment so that you can successfully reach the rescue or return to Earth!",
    "about_the_game": "RESBS is a first-person space survival simulation where you and your friends cooperate to survive in zero gravity on a space station.Your movement is completely free, without any restrictions on direction.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/18ed20c667eefef98301422a77da92cc.poster.avif?t=1677268388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/18ed20c667eefef98301422a77da92cc.webm?t=1677268388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/18ed20c667eefef98301422a77da92cc.mp4?t=1677268388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>When your crew encounters an emergency during a mission and loses contact with Earth and resources, you need all the materials at your disposal to survive in a vacuum.<br>\u00b7Growing vegetables in space<br>\u00b7Exploring abandoned space stations<br>\u00b7Searching for supplies<br>\u00b7Repairing space capsules destroyed by space debris.<br>\u00b7If necessary, you even need to do the docking of the capsule.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/1c532aa00014fdba68498fa128f3f9bc.poster.avif?t=1677268388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/1c532aa00014fdba68498fa128f3f9bc.webm?t=1677268388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964720/extras/1c532aa00014fdba68498fa128f3f9bc.mp4?t=1677268388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The outer equipment and outer shell of the space station are often damaged by space debris. You need to wear a heavy space suit to repair the outer shell of the space station in the vacuum. <br>In short, you need to arrange your resources properly, expand your farm, and acquire more equipment so that you can successfully reach the rescue or return to Earth!",
